flowchart TD
    A["1 Read input, remove duplicates<br/>one record per genome; qc/dedup_report.tsv"]
    B["2 Round-1 annotation<br/>13 protein genes, 2 rRNAs, 22 tRNAs; circular or linear checked"]
    C["3 Re-orient<br/>plus strand, start at cox1 (--which_gene_first)"]
    D["4 Check after re-orientation (round 2)<br/>--if_reannotation_2 auto: only records the shift broke"]
    E["5 Write GenBank<br/>original header (organism, references, voucher) copied back"]
    F["6 Add what the core missed<br/>12S / 16S (rRNA HMM), introns; MITOS2 with --rescue"]
    G["7 Curate<br/>gene ends and names to NCBI rules"]
    H["8 ORFs of unknown function, non-coding regions<br/>ORFs under selection as CDS (qc/orf_report.tsv); NCRs"]
    I["9 NCBI check and submission files<br/>table2asn -> submission/"]
    J["10 Compare with the original annotation<br/>qc/original_vs_mitom.tsv (GenBank input)"]
    K["11 Genome maps<br/>annotation/plots/"]
    L["12 Organise the output<br/>summary.tsv, annotation/, submission/, qc/, input/, logs/"]

    A --> B --> C --> D --> E --> F --> G --> H --> I --> J --> K --> L
